Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted.
Update Groonga to 16.1.4, the newest release. PGroonga 4.x, the only
PGroonga for PostgreSQL 18, needs Groonga 14.1 or later. The autotools
build and its options are unchanged; the PLIST follows the new headers,
plugins and documentation.
Not submitted upstream.

